WEBVTT

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:40.660
Ran Shuuei spurred his horse to pass through the palace gate of Kiyou.

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:49.290
It was possible that the Section of Government Inspection was planning to arrest Ran Shuuei there

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:53.800
and interrogate him about the connection between the murderer of the Vice Minister of Arms and the Ran family.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:55.790
Will I make it?

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.560
Shuurei-dono...

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:06.900
I'm glad you made it in time.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.560
I've gotten the gate guards drunk.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:18.520
Please go now, before Seiga arrives.

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:23.870
Thank you, Shuurei-dono.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:29.720
Farewell.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.620
You let Ran Shuuei escape, didn't you?

00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:00.390
I was planning to take my time interrogating him

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:03.260
about the connection between the Ran family and that assassin.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:04.980
What are you talking about?

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:07.790
No one was around by the time I got here.

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:09.910
Well...

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:15.520
it doesn't matter now that messages have been sent to all the checkpoints on the way to Ranshuu.

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:22.930
Not that Ran Shuuei would get caught by that kind of trick.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.490
She outwitted me and let Ran Shuuei escape, huh?

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:31.580
She's decisive, she's quick, and
she has the ability to think ahead.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:36.770
I see. She has qualities that Kouki-sama appreciates.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.190
What are you grinning about, Seiga?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.430
What? If you have something against me, say it!

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.760
You're an interesting woman.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:53.040
That expression on your face is my favorite.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.450
Try your best to stay close to me.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:58.340
You hear me? I don't want anyone other than me to make you cry.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.350
That would reduce my fun.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.960
Drop that conceited attitude!

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:04.830
I'm not trying to catch up with you!

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.440
I'm going to Ranshuu.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.850
I'm leaving Tei Yuushun in charge.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.140
Why? You're the Emperor, remember?

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:30.760
Don't go running around when we're not even at war.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.120
It's important.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.620
To you as a person?

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.560
Or as the Emperor?

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:38.380
If you're going, then make a distinction between the two.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:46.640
To me as a person, or to me as the Emperor...

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:50.930
I—

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:54.000
If you're in doubt, then don't even bother answering.

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:59.320
If the Emperor falters, then so will his vassals.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.680
Fine, go ahead.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:08.320
You seem to need some time off in Ranshuu to cool off and think.

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:11.610
Your Highness!

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:14.580
What about Jyuusan-hime?!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.500
I say it's a good match.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.560
If you choose Jyuusan-hime, the Ministry of Mystic Study will approve of her becoming the Empress!

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:21.490
Good point.

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:24.270
Make your decision before you leave for Ranshuu.

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:26.710
Umm, I mean... please wait a while.

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:28.700
What do you mean "a while"?!

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.350
That is... I mean...

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:38.250
I know! Because I'm taking Jyuusan-hime with me to Ranshuu!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:43.460
I need a guide, and I want to get to know her better by going on a journey with her!

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:45.490
I'll decide what to do when I get back.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.070
He chickened out.

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:52.690
Your Highness! I'm so delighted!

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.890
Finally, finally this day has come!

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:57.860
Hold on a second! I didn't say that I'd get married!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:02.800
Ranshuu is a beautiful place indeed,
a perfect destination for a prenuptial holiday!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.040
Do your best!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.040
That backfired on me.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:05.460
Oh!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:11.470
Your Highness, just in case, you don't have any plans to visit Kyuusai Cove in Ranshuu, do you?

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:13.720
Kyuusai Cove?

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:17.480
I think I've heard of that place before.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:20.550
Hmm, I'm probably not going there.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:22.580
I'm glad to hear that.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:28.030
That area has been the subject of an unfavorable omen, so please do not approach it.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:28.740
Okay.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.360
Your Highness, what about your bodyguards?

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:32.720
Bodyguards?

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:35.480
You cannot take a troop of soldiers to Ranshuu with you,

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.750
especially when you don't have any real reason to go there.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.610
You should keep your departure confidential from the outset.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.620
In that case, your bodyguards must be a select few.

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.010
I'll arrange someone for that.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:52.360
The soldiers would only spoil the precious prenuptial holiday.

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:57.090
Your Highness should take Jyuusan-hime and whomever else you'd like.

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:00.020
You say you'll arrange someone, but who?

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:04.270
Kokurou.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.390
Kokurou?

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:10.900
Indeed, Kokurou can readily protect Your Highness and a few others.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.270
The legendary Kokurou...

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:18.500
Very well, it's the word of none other than Shou-Taishi.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:28.760
Son, the Minister of Arms, is away, Koku-daishogun.

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:33.760
It's locked.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.300
That's because he's away.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:43.690
Excuse me. This is Koku Yousei,
Daishogun of the Left Urin Army.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:48.440
Minister Son.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.850
Minister Son is pretending to be absent.

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:55.120
No, I mean, he <i>is</i> absent.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:00.540
Are you here to talk about Ran Shuuei?

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:04.010
Whom should I appoint next? Do you have any suggestions?

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:05.400
I'll leave it to you.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:09.240
Someone like me should not have a say in the decision.

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:10.900
Is that so?

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:14.720
Then I'll choose and appoint someone convenient for me.

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:28.400
Would you please stop glaring at me?

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:32.190
I was only attempting to communicate mentally.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.240
As if that's possible, you idiot.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.680
Just use your mouth and speak.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:37.850
You look as though you're trying to challenge me.

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:42.000
What are you planning, Minister Son?

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.900
Nothing really special.

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.830
Nothing I need to tell you.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.590
Huh?

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:56.940
Tan-tan, can't you climb a bit more quietly?

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:00.600
I've never climbed a tree before!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:05.280
It's not like we're trespassing.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.080
It's obviously strange that the
Vice Minister was assassinated

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.110
and that the Minister of Arms is away.

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:14.130
We're just checking if he's pretending to be absent.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.680
Minister Son of the Ministry of Arms is away, oujo-san.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.800
Uh-oh.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:23.450
He's here! You must be Minister Son!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.410
Nope!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.260
But!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:33.250
I've given you a piece of candy, so please leave, oujo-san.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.680
Koku-daishogun, escort her back.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:49.200
You can't get around me by feeding me candy, Minister Son!

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.940
Please be gotten around.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:55.150
Really, this isn't the place where you should die.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.210
What?!

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.540
H-Hey, just a min—

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:13.440
Forget that you came here today, or that you saw him.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:17.840
Koku-daishogun, what kind of person is Minister Son?

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:22.290
A splendid person. I respect him from my heart.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:32.310
I hear that someone tried to sneak into Minister Son's office.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.650
Do you know anything about it?

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.780
I-It definitely wasn't me.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:37.920
I see.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.310
Then you can't possibly claim that Minister Son was pretending to be absent, can you?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:45.240
If you did, then you'd be fired for contradicting my words.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:49.130
I told you that the case of the Vice Minister of Arms is closed.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:51.920
Which way will you choose: to be fired, or to pretend ignorance?

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:55.500
Director General Ki, it's extremely obvious why he's pretending to be absent!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.620
He's just trying to avoid further interrogation by the Section of Government Inspection!

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:01.410
He's making fools of us! Are you all right with that?!

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.040
Absolutely all right.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:07.810
Unlike some girl, I'm not doing my job out of concern for my own personal honor.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.990
L-Let's be concerned about our own personal honor.

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:15.060
I think it would be very attractive if Director General Ki was concerned about his own personal honor...

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:16.030
probably.

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:17.430
What do you mean by "probably"?

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:18.710
Don't be impertinent.

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:23.200
Then, I promise to give up on the case of the Vice Minister of Arms.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.200
In return, please let me go to Ranshuu!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.470
Not again.

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.160
I'll ask you however many times it takes.

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:33.060
The previous Governor of Ranshuu was Son Ryouou-dono,

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:35.400
the current Minister of Arms.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.580
That's who you're after, isn't it?

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:39.960
You haven't changed your mind at all!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:46.210
In the meantime, you intend to investigate about the salt, personnel affairs, and the assassins, isn't that right?

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:48.720
I beg you! Please let me investigate them!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.380
So now you assume a subservient attitude.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:52.550
Otherwise, I'd need to have the upper hand over you.

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:54.460
Give me a break from your stupid jokes.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:07.620
Fine, but you may only depart when I tell you to.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.260
What?

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:11.130
If you ask me again, then this case is over.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:15.960
Thank you so much!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:21.230
Oh, in that case, could you please sign and put your seal on this?

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:40.820
What? You're going to Ranshuu?

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.860
Even though you've been turned down every day?

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.350
Yes, I got the permission of the Director General.

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:47.820
Oh?

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:51.360
Permission? Isn't it more like you persuaded him?

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:54.350
Umm... so, Tan-tan...

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:57.330
It's okay. I can come with you to Ranshuu.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.070
Really?

00:12:58.070 --> 00:12:59.940
Thanks, Tan-tan!

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:03.090
But are you sure you can leave your father on his own?

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:06.300
He should be fine, now that my mom is back.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.590
What? Your mother?

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.800
It's amazing that she had the nerve to come back.

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:12.570
My dad's a fool too for welcoming her back so happily.

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:15.540
Well, in any case, they'll do fine without me.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:16.600
Is that so?

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.380
So, what about a bodyguard?

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:22.360
Are you going to ask your bamboo-shooting family retainer, as usual?

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:27.280
Seiran should... probably stay in Kiyou.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:32.290
Ran-shogun's gone now, so it's better if he stays near Ryuuki.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:35.540
Anyway, I've got plans.

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.290
Huh?

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:47.510
Would you please not disturb my studies?

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:50.720
Oujo-sama is going to Ranshuu.

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:53.220
Oh, so she obtained permission?

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.450
You're going too.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.580
I have the National Exam coming up...

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:57.700
As her bodyguard.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:00.480
Work for once, and earn the rice you eat.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.320
Why don't you go with the Princess?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:08.070
I already have work to do, in addition to being Yuushun-dono's bodyguard.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:12.970
Just go with oujo-sama.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.350
But the National Exam...

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:15.680
Like I care.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:24.110
I haven't been to Ranshuu for a long time.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:29.470
Still, how should I explain that I'll be away from home for a while,

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:33.840
because I'm going, as Kokurou, to be His Highness's bodyguard?

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.090
Oh, Your Highness!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.720
Shouka.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:39.520
Yes?

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.480
I'm sorry for the short notice,

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.150
but please come with me to Ranshuu.

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:46.300
Huh?

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:51.780
He can't possibly... know that I'm Kokurou. Even so...

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:57.670
I can't explain it very well, but I just want you to come with me this time, no matter what.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:01.430
It's going to be a long journey, and possibly dangerous too, but rest assured!

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:02.880
The best bodyguard is coming along!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.050
That's me!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.800
In the worst case, I'll protect Shouka with my life!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.650
P-Please.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:16.310
I understand. I'll accompany you.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.810
It might not look like it, but I think I can be more useful than Your Highness imagines.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.810
Y-You will?

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:27.690
I was supposed to follow them secretly, but now I can go with them openly.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.730
What's my Princess doing, studying the record of the nobility?

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:40.840
Don't you have work to do, Anjuu-sama?

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.870
I heard you're going to Ranshuu.

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.700
You have sharp ears.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.550
Yes, I'm going there for work.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:49.290
So, what are you doing with the record of the nobility?

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:54.010
I thought I'd study the nobility before I go to Ranshuu.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.940
Anjuu-sama, you're the Vice Secretary of the Department of Counsel, aren't you?

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:59.140
That means you're an expert on nobles, right?

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:03.380
What would you say about helping an admirable girl who's in trouble?

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.230
How about a smile as a reward?

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.750
That's very cute, but no.

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:13.520
Though, speaking of nobles, I'll tell you one thing.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:17.140
I can tell you something about your superior, Kouki.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.740
About Director General Ki?

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:22.540
Do you know anything about him?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.620
No, nothing.

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:28.670
He's the sole survivor of the distinguished Ki family.

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:30.670
Survivor?!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:33.840
It was a family with a long history and tradition.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.920
However, nearly the entire family was wiped out by the previous Emperor.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:39.180
The only survivor is Kouki.

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:42.180
Wiped out... For what reason?

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:45.480
The reason doesn't matter.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:52.190
What does matter, Princess, is that the previous Emperor made his decision and executed it—

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:56.380
something the Emperor and the seven families of Sai are easily capable of doing.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:59.830
Lots of noble families have perished that way.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:07.360
My superior, Ou Ki-sama, took care of the nobles that became outcasts.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.120
What kind of person is he?

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.750
Ou Ki-sama?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:11.960
Let's see...

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:15.360
I think of him as the last noble.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:20.220
I don't think there will ever be a noble among nobles like him again.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.220
A noble among nobles?

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:26.610
Yes. Even if he were broke, he'd still be a noble.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:29.360
I can't find any other words to describe him.

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:31.780
A noble among nobles...

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.960
Ou Ki, I'm coming in.

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.920
Ryouou, stop wandering about.

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:46.450
You're supposed to be out of Kiyou right now.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.340
Just as someone ordered.

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:53.140
I like to watch the moon from here.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:18:00.510
Cherry blossoms in spring, fireflies in summer, maples in autumn, and snow in winter.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:05.620
All you need in life is flowers, good drinks, and beautiful women.

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:08.920
You were always like that.

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:09.720
You're right.

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:12.510
That's why I don't need a position like Minister of Arms.

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:14.230
You can do whatever you want with it.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:22.190
Before you know it, we'll both be over fifty.

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:25.520
What's this? Do you miss being a teenager?

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:26.660
No kidding.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.400
No matter when it is, "now" is the best moment of my life.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:32.790
That's my belief. Why should I be sorry about my past?

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:40.180
What do you desire, Ou Ki?

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.330
Shall I tell you my desire first?

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:50.560
If you become Emperor, then I'll be content.

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:55.010
You expect that I haven't changed?

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.820
Do you realize how much time has gone by?

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:04.830
I'll tell you what I desire, Ryouou.

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:09.530
The throne.

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:17.660
Do as you wish.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:20.380
I'll follow you wherever you go, my friend.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:23.030
You won't regret it, Ryouou.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.020
What a beautiful moon.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:40.110
I've stayed too long. I'm off now.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:46.120
Be careful when you go to Ranshuu.

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:49.950
Don't get caught by some worthless man again.

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:58.860
You've been caught by a worthless man before?

00:19:58.860 --> 00:19:59.740
I have.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:03.750
That bamboo shooter is less competent than I thought.

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:07.110
Umm, Tan-tan, I said "caught," but—

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:09.490
Why not? It reassures me, actually.

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:16.620
Rather than pushing yourself to live alone,
I think you're better suited to living with someone.

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:22.040
Leaving marriage aside, couldn't you at least let yourself fall in love?

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:29.490
I'll have a talk with Jyuusan-hime about that assassin.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:39.360
Hey, Emperor!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:43.090
Is it true that you're taking me to Ranshuu for a honeymoon?!

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.480
A honeymoon?!

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:45.510
Who said that?

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:46.800
Shou-Taishi.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.470
That old git!

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:50.280
Old git! Old git!

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:51.470
Damn it!

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:55.480
It's true about going to Ranshuu.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.310
With me?

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:59.610
I need a guide.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.930
It's not a honeymoon.

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.050
You chickened out.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:11.480
Isn't Shuuei-nii-sama fortunate?
The Emperor himself is coming after him.

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:12.830
You've made plans, I assume?

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:15.080
Of course, my love!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:22.730
I don't know if he'll come with you when you go to see him, but why not give it a shot?

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:27.090
However, be prepared to back down if you have to.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:31.130
It's normal to find yourself loving someone, but not being loved back.

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:33.460
You should think about how the other person feels.

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:39.530
Even when you love each other,
if staying together only brings misfortune,

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:43.440
then it's best to split up,
no matter how much it breaks your heart.

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:47.390
That kind of fate... probably does exist.

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:49.370
Hey, Emperor...

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:52.450
Ryuuki... is he there?

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:57.160
Isn't that what you call "being considerate"?

00:21:57.770 --> 00:22:01.430
Something you consider to be most important in this world?

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:08.840
What am I talking about? Idiot! Stupid!

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:11.060
Well, see you, Emperor!

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:13.350
Ah...

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:15.900
What is it?

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:18.480
Umm, nothing.

00:22:18.770 --> 00:22:24.110
Shuuei-nii-sama's gone, Shusui-san is missing, and Shuurei-chan isn't around,

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:25.360
so you're lonely, aren't you?

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:27.990
Yeah.

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:33.480
Of course, you must be lonely.

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:38.000
Well, I can stay a little longer.

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:04.260
I'm glad. Ryuuki can express his feelings to Jyuusan-hime.

00:23:05.190 --> 00:23:10.050
Even if I'm not around, he won't have to spend his nights alone.

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:13.530
He doesn't have to feel lonely.

00:23:17.990 --> 00:23:21.320
Really... I'm glad.

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:49.170
I see. Ryuuki won't be lonely anymore, even if I'm not with him.

00:24:49.430 --> 00:24:50.700
I'm glad.

00:24:50.700 --> 00:24:53.570
But then, why do I have these pent-up feelings?

00:24:53.570 --> 00:24:56.090
Would I feel better if I punched Seiga?

00:24:56.090 --> 00:24:57.680
Where <i>is</i> Seiga?
